    tips: ["I'm going to… in August.", "We're staying at…", "I think the weather will be…", "Why don't you come…?", "I'll send you…"],
    checklist: ["I used going to for plans", "I used will for a promise or a prediction", "I used in (months), on (days), at (times)", "I started with “Hi…” and ended with a friendly sentence"],
